           "id": "52074d5c",
           "settings": {
            "editor": "<p class=\"lead fade-up\">Your air handler is the heart of your HVAC system, moving conditioned air throughout your home. At Newman Air, we provide professional air handler installation and repair in Johnson City, TN, to keep your system running smoothly when you need it most. If you’ve noticed uneven temperatures, weak airflow, or strange noises, reach out to us today to schedule service.</p>"
