            "css_classes": "prose-block"
           },
           "elements": [
            {
             "id": "520aa050",
             "settings": {
              "title": "Why Choose Us For an Air Handler Installation and Repair?",
              "header_size": "h2",
              "typography_font_size": {
               "unit": "custom",
               "size": "clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.45rem)",
               "sizes": []
              },
              "typography_font_size_tablet": {
               "unit": "custom",
               "size": "clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.45rem)",
               "sizes": []
              },
              "typography_font_size_mobile": {
               "unit": "custom",
               "size": "clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.45rem)",
               "sizes": []
              },
              "typography_typography": "custom"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520ab3a7",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>When your air handler needs service or replacement, you want a team that knows how to get it right the first time. We’ll handle everything from diagnosis to installation with professionalism, keeping your comfort front and center. Since 1984, we’ve built our name on reliable service and local trust, and we bring that same dedication to every home we visit. Here’s what makes us the right choice:</p><ul><li>Honest estimates with no surprise add-ons</li><li>A “Done right” guarantee on our work</li><li>Polite, skilled technicians who respect your property</li><li>A locally owned company, proud to serve the community</li></ul>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520ac6fe",
             "settings": {
              "title": "When Your Air Handler Becomes a Problem",
              "header_size": "h3"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520ada55",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>A failing air handler can leave your home uncomfortable and your system working harder than it should. Since it controls airflow, even small issues can quickly affect your heating and cooling. Common signs to watch for include:</p><ul><li>Uneven temperatures in different rooms</li><li>Weak or inconsistent airflow from vents</li><li>Strange noises such as rattling or squealing</li><li>Higher energy bills without a clear cause</li></ul>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520aedac",
             "settings": {
              "title": "Flexible Financing Options",
              "header_size": "h3"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b0103",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>Installing or replacing an air handler can feel like a big expense, but financing makes it easier to manage. Through GoodLeap, Synchrony and Hearth, we provide flexible payment options that spread out the cost over time. This helps you get the service you need now without delaying important repairs. We’ll walk you through the process, so you understand your choices.</p>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b145a",
             "settings": {
              "title": "How Our Team Solves the Issue",
              "header_size": "h3"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b27b1",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>When you call us for air handler service, our technicians will start with a full system inspection. We’ll check the blower motor, fan, filters, and other components to find the root cause. If repairs can restore its performance, we’ll make them on the spot. If replacement is the better option, we’ll recommend a high-efficiency model that matches your HVAC system. Either way, you’ll get clear communication and reliable results.</p>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b3b08",
             "settings": {
              "title": "Risks of Ignoring Your Air Handler Issues",
              "header_size": "h3"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b4e5f",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>If you choose to delay service on your air handler, it can create larger and more expensive problems. Since this part affects the airflow, the rest of your system has to work even harder when it’s not functioning properly. This can lead to:</p><ul><li>Premature breakdown of your HVAC unit</li><li>Higher energy bills every month</li><li>Poor indoor air quality from clogged or dirty components</li><li>Frequent hot and cold spots in your home</li></ul>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b61b6",
             "settings": {
              "title": "The Benefits of Professional Service",
              "header_size": "h3"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "heading",
             "elType": "widget"
            },
            {
             "id": "520b750d",
             "settings": {
              "editor": "<p>Timely installation or repair of your air handler keeps your HVAC system efficient and your home comfortable. You’ll notice an immediate difference in airflow and overall system performance. Here are some of the benefits:</p><ul><li>Consistent temperatures in every room</li><li>Lower operating costs with a properly functioning system</li><li>Better air quality with clean, efficient circulation</li><li>Extended lifespan of your HVAC equipment</li></ul>"
             },
             "elements": [],
             "isInner": true,
             "widgetType": "text-editor",
             "elType": "widget"
            }
           ],
           "isInner": true,
           "elType": "container"
          }
         ],
         "isInner": true,
         "elType": "container"
        },
